{
 "id": "move:trillion-amie-to-apps",
 "about": "The Amie rebuild (mail pane, shared calendar, task pane and task views, month cards, visual database views; Sep 27 to Nov 3 2026) left files in Trillion-X/trillion that no new tree held: every file at the tag old-trillion-before-worker-retire touched by a commit whose message names amie, shared calendar, mail pane, visual database, task pane or month card, that is not a row of trillion-workshop docs/worker-retirement-port-backlog.json and has no same-bytes, receipt or same-name home on trillion-apps, trillion-workshop or trillion-rust main. The screen side (the screens' tests, the Amie reference and its pixel index, the client's dev scripts and their data) moves byte for byte into trillion-apps web/ under its source paths; the two account features go to the Workshop (move-rows/trillion-amie-to-workshop.json). keep: the old Worker's stores (parts/eeaf, parts/record-log: storage is trillion-rust's) and every file a port backlog slice still owns (src/contract-*.mjs, src/native-workspace-record-reader.mjs, src/engine-tools.mjs, src/getting-there.*, src/who-does-it.*, src/work-marketplace.mjs, scripts/workshop-rows.mjs, ...): a test that imports one is held until that slice lands. read_as_rows: a file trillion-apps main already holds at the same place with newer bytes (web/package.json, web/scripts/compiled-modules.mjs, web/scripts/screen-modules.mjs, show-of.ts, placeable-surface-record.ts) is not copied: the moved file reads that copy. A file whose home is in the Workshop (wall-time.ts, ask-your-ai.mjs, configurations.mjs, open-choices.json, json-expansion.mjs, loading-mark) is not copied: the moved file imports it from the trillion-workshop package (import paths only). test/engine-tools-for-tests.mjs is not followed: the engines are trillion-rust's, and the stand-in reaches them only when a test runs one. wrangler.jsonc moves as data: test/workers-stand-in-for-tests.mjs reads its Durable Object binding names.",
 "source": {
  "name": "Trillion-X/trillion",
  "commit": "b6ae0ebf815f2f5271eed34e6e023c7e1767ec04",
  "test_folders": [
   "test"
  ]
 },
 "destination": {
  "name": "Trillion-X/trillion-apps",
  "package": "trillion-apps",
  "shared_folder": "web"
 },
 "keep": [
  "src/chat-import.mjs",
  "src/chat-archives.mjs",
  "src/ai-conversations-list.json",
  "parts/record-log/**",
  "parts/eeaf/**",
  "src/contract-checkout.mjs",
  "src/contract-entitlements.mjs",
  "src/native-workspace-record-reader.mjs",
  "parts/ui/show/coss/ui/toast.tsx",
  "scripts/tool-bundles.mjs",
  "scripts/workshop-rows.mjs",
  "src/automation-health-looks.json",
  "src/automation-health.mjs",
  "src/built-in-tools.mjs",
  "src/compare-readings.mjs",
  "src/engine-tools.mjs",
  "src/getting-there.json",
  "src/getting-there.mjs",
  "src/rules-over-records.mjs",
  "src/who-does-it.json",
  "src/who-does-it.mjs",
  "src/work-marketplace.mjs",
  "src/workflow-definition-runner.mjs"
 ],
